<title>UK: TABLE-Carpetright year profits jump 28 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Carpetright year profits jump 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 26, 1997 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 28.5		  vs  22.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  11.5		  vs  n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  19.0		  vs  14.5</p>
<p> Pretax			32.3		  vs  25.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   233.9		  vs 185.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 29.5 and 32.4 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Carpetright Plc</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
